<p>Lay a simple yet effective trap that explodes in a radius 2 on contact, setting those affected on fire for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">249, 293, 326, 355, 380</acronym> fire damage over 3 turns.</p><p>This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.</p>